      "difficulty": "medium",
      "question": "小华书写过氧化氢分解的化学方程式：H₂O₂→H₂O+O₂↑（MnO₂）。他的错误在于？",
      "options": [
        "没有配平，氧原子数目不等",
        "O₂不应该标↑（反应物有液体）",
        "MnO₂不应写在箭头上",
        "H₂O不应写为液体"
      ],
      "answer": 0,
      "explanation": "左边2个O，右边3个O（H₂O中1个+O₂中2个），未配平。正确应为2H₂O₂→2H₂O+O₂↑。",
      "errorType": "mc-equation-gas-precipitate-confusion",
      "remediationStep": "L28-S04",
      "knowledgeIds": [
        "equation-writing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "L28-D02",
      "type": "concept",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "question": "下列化学方程式中，气体符号标注错误的是？",
      "options": [
        "C+O₂→CO₂↑（点燃）——反应物有气体O₂",
        "Zn+H₂SO₄→ZnSO₄+H₂↑",
        "2H₂O₂→2H₂O+O₂↑（MnO₂）",
        "CaCO₃→CaO+CO₂↑（高温）"
      ],
      "answer": 0,
      "explanation": "C+O₂→CO₂中反应物已有气体O₂，生成CO₂不需要标↑。",
      "errorType": "mc-equation-gas-precipitate-confusion",
      "remediationStep": "L28-S06",
      "knowledgeIds": [
        "equation-writing"
      ]
    },
    {
